{{#*inline "title"}}The Mine | Twennie{{/inline}}

<section class="teach-me-page">

  <div class="pareto-visual">
    <img src="/images/minerbluey.png" alt="The Mine">
  </div>

  <h1 class="teach-me-main-heading">The Mine</h1>

  <div class="teach-me-orientation">
    <div class="orientation-block">
      <h2 class="orientation-heading">capture early signals before they become formal opportunities</h2>
      <p class="orientation-intro">
        The Mine is Twennie’s team space for Nuggets — small pieces of early intelligence that help firms notice projects, clients, regions, and opportunities worth watching.
      </p>
      <ul class="orientation-list">
        <li>Nuggets are designed for teams, not solo learners.</li>
        <li>They help groups capture and monitor early-stage opportunities together.</li>
        <li>They become more valuable when leaders and members can assign, discuss, and track them.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="teach-me-feature-strip">

    <div class="teach-me-feature-card">
      <img src="/images/minerbluey.png" alt="The Mine mascot" class="teach-me-feature-image">
      <button class="teach-me-toggle is-open" type="button">
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-label">why you need to upgrade</span>
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-arrow"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="teach-me-feature-body">
        <ul class="teach-me-feature-list">
          <li>The Mine is a collaborative intelligence space, so it is reserved for group and leader memberships.</li>
          <li>Individual memberships are built for personal learning, reflection, and note-taking — not shared opportunity tracking.</li>
          <li>Upgrading gives you access to a workflow designed for teams who want to monitor opportunities together.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="teach-me-feature-card">
      <img src="/images/blueygroup.png" alt="Group membership" class="teach-me-feature-image">
      <button class="teach-me-toggle is-open" type="button">
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-label">what group membership unlocks</span>
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-arrow"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="teach-me-feature-body">
        <ul class="teach-me-feature-list">
          <li>Access Nuggets shared by your leader or team</li>
          <li>Monitor opportunities together</li>
          <li>See assigned Nuggets in your dashboard</li>
          <li>Participate in early-stage project intelligence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="teach-me-feature-card">
      <img src="/images/leaderbluey_2.png" alt="Leader membership" class="teach-me-feature-image">
      <button class="teach-me-toggle is-open" type="button">
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-label">why leaders use this</span>
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-arrow"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="teach-me-feature-body">
        <ul class="teach-me-feature-list">
          <li>Create and assign Nuggets</li>
          <li>Track who is monitoring what</li>
          <li>Build a team-wide early intelligence habit</li>
          <li>Use Nuggets as part of business development leadership</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="teach-me-container">
    <div class="teach-me-columns">

      <div class="teach-me-column">
        <h2 class="column-heading">individual membership</h2>
        <p class="teach-me-column-intro">
          Individual memberships are built for personal learning, reflection, prompt completion, and note-taking.
        </p>
        <ul class="teach-me-column-list">
          <li>Access Twennie learning units</li>
          <li>Complete prompt sets</li>
          <li>Keep personal learning notes</li>
          <li>Review your own progress reports</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="teach-me-column">
        <h2 class="column-heading">group membership</h2>
        <p class="teach-me-column-intro">
          Group memberships add shared team learning, assignments, and collaborative workflows.
        </p>
        <ul class="teach-me-column-list">
          <li>Access Nuggets shared by your leader or team</li>
          <li>Monitor opportunities together</li>
          <li>See assigned Nuggets in your dashboard</li>
          <li>Participate in early-stage project intelligence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="teach-me-column">
        <h2 class="column-heading">leader membership</h2>
        <p class="teach-me-column-intro">
          Leader memberships are designed for managing development, guiding teams, and creating visibility across a group.
        </p>
        <ul class="teach-me-column-list">
          <li>Create and assign Nuggets</li>
          <li>Track who is monitoring what</li>
          <li>Build a team-wide early intelligence habit</li>
          <li>Use Nuggets as part of business development leadership</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="promptset-cta-buttons">
    <h2 class="section-title">ready to unlock the mine?</h2>
    <div class="cta-button-group">
